<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes launched from Ethiopia have hit homes and a UN building near Sudan's capital, killing four, while Sudanese forces intercepted additional drones aimed at Khartoum. Clashes along Ethiopia's southern borders with Kenya and internal regional fights have displaced about 700,000 people, prompting a UK travel warning for Moyale and a Kenyan priest urging continued welcome for refugees. A Kenyan priest called for continued welcome of refugees fleeing the fighting, and a US legislator proposed linking trade incentives to peace with Ethiopia and Eritrea. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOVmVOMVBwMHpITm9Tc3d3TkN6OUpNSGU3QkxMUEtGeUNLSnlaemg3TU9paTNtSDN1amFyQW9wU2FtSm43endXaFVhSnBSUjVPR01NUnlSeFVtZjVvbUhrd0lkNWZCdkhVZ3MyZ2pqZ2VPNk8yVGtGNlp2NXBqcm1USzRyMGxNcHRYX0t3VVhxOWY1TnRqWXRwWWxCRUxLUEYwbnlyQ053?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.daily-sun.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Українські Національні Новини (УНН)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNbkxqb0VrZjlDdHZQYVBMUjFvclVSNHJET1FhSXV5SHRXS1R0R3FFS2ZndjZudVc1RWFzZXZVQUhFSktZcVpsdU9RWG01QVNHVlVuMjBvT0liUGVELUdta093MmtqWndvM0lZR09nS0dteUlzd0JRX3htbWk2Y0U4SXM5MFJMWG92cXJEWHMwY1lUOC03ajVsQm9XRzQ1bVk3TGVZMUZaallEZVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ethiopia Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbEk4ZmpVdWlfUW8zOHlwSWNWMjFMQVk4M0xKdXJJRXNBbUJpVFVpT1JSMUFXd2xGR1g4U0NTNTZwRlpFMXJRV1R3ZFpmaXVXaUYyaEc5bnF5ejJyQy1GZ216UDAxOHVOVzAtWmxjVnZlY3ZnX0NqRnljZG5QWTZMYWVaUWRWaTdTalhSUnNscTNpRWZlTDdGeXY2WFU4ak5pa2lqWS1SRk56elM5MjVjQnJRbTRNQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;EWTN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNNGdHOTFpWkRzb0xudHlKeHQzTzkz